Package: SampleCrossSection
Title: Sample Size Calculation for Cross-Sectional Analytical Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Victor J.", "Vera-Ponce", email = "victor_jvp@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculates the required sample size for multivariable analysis of associated factors in cross-sectional analytical studies using the events per variable (EPV) method. The package is designed for studies using Poisson regression with robust variance to estimate prevalence ratios (PR).
